OL,3,GNEWSASenedd member Sarah Cooper-Lesadd
OL,4,Aquits Reform to join Plaid Cymru
OL,5,
OL,6,FA member of the Senedd has quit Reform
OL,7,Fand joined Plaid Cymru, saying her
OL,8,Fformer party has "no interest in
OL,9,FWales".
OL,11,FSarah Cooper-Lesadd's defection was
OL,12,Fapproved by Plaid's Senedd group and
OL,13,Fnational executive on Tuesday.
OL,15,FIt means Plaid, which won May's Senedd
OL,16,Felection, now has 44 members, leaving
OL,17,FReform - the largest opposition party -
OL,18,Fwith 33 seats.
OL,20,FCooper-Lesadd, a former Conservative,
OL,21,Fwas elected for the Pen-y-bont Bro
OL,22,FMorgannwg constituency.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
